From 2d96bb12ae9e874e9d0a08f6b3237725f1f7f7a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 10:49:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: open the v2.9.0 rung

Four changes sit on top of the v2.8.9 image, three of them in rc/, so this is a
real rebuild rather than a www refresh. A minor bump rather than v2.8.10: the
rung removes a shipped vendor test hook and adds a firewall feature, which is
more than a patch-level fix.

  527460ce10  firewall UI: pending-changes banner, and the Exempt column no
              longer says "any" when it means none
  8f39b133ed  the Service Intercept and banner tokens in all 24 languages
  05716172d1  audit tier 1 - vendor USB test hook removed; the firmware check
              and its notification fire once instead of twice; Warden's
              "Update now" no longer blocks rc's service loop; the policy
              routing heal gives up after 5 attempts; list writes tighten
              their permissions before any content exists

Also in this rung, already carried by the v2.8.9 test image: the four audit
fixes (fqdn set poisoning, shell WAN poll, rtrafd cadence constants, stubby
restart) and Service Intercept itself.
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 1d8705465c..2b1ba37446 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.8.9
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.9.0
 
 RCNO=0
-- 
2.25.1

